/*
  GeofenceDrawer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal/dialog · 0011 · GeofenceDrawer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  GeofenceDrawer resolves (table "GeofenceDrawer") lives here with its English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web source (components/maps/GeofenceDrawer.tsx) is an anonymous passive
  controller with no `t()` calls; its only user-facing prose is the `describeFence`
  string, promoted here to keys. The remainder backs the native modal chrome
  (header, draw toolbar, saved list, the loading / empty / error envelope, the
  freshness chip + connectivity banner) and the VoiceOver builders.
*/

